{"change_summary":"Implemented both pending shrimp-loop amendments. `crates/tank_core/src/save.rs` now seeds legacy v3→v4 `animal.reserve_g` from existing adult+juvenile shrimp biomass instead of relying on a zero serde default, so upgraded colonies keep a usable starting reserve. `crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs` now raises `water.alkalinity_meq_total` whenever shrimp excretion or respiration releases TAN, preserving the intended NH3/NH4+ buffering coupling. I updated `crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs` to lock in biomass-based reserve seeding for migrated v3 saves and extended shrimp feeding regressions in `crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs` plus `crates/tank_core/tests/shrimp_feeding_pathway.rs` to cover the alkalinity path.","outstanding_risks":["Legacy v3 reserve seeding is necessarily heuristic: it reconstructs `reserve_g` from current shrimp biomass and `LIVE_BIOMASS_ORGANIC_FRACTION_G_PER_G`, because older saves do not contain the true historical reserve state.","The worktree still contains the pre-existing untracked `.ralph-burning/` directory, which I left untouched."],"steps":[{"description":"Patched the v3→v4 save migration so missing `animal.reserve_g` is seeded from legacy shrimp population biomass instead of defaulting to zero on load.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Patched `route_consumed_food` so TAN released by shrimp excretion and respiration also adds the corresponding alkalinity, with explicit stoichiometric comments in code.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Added regression coverage for migration seeding and alkalinity coupling, then ran formatting, targeted suites, the full `tank_core` test suite, and clippy.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test save_load` passed (19 tests), including `legacy_schema_v3_saves_seed_reserve_from_existing_shrimp_biomass`.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test shrimp_feeding_pathway` passed (8 tests), including the new alkalinity assertion in `feeding_generates_tan_and_dic_and_feces`.","`cargo test -p tank_core --lib` passed (16 tests), including `systems::shrimp::tests::oxygen_limited_respiration_scales_dissolved_fluxes_and_retains_shortfall` with the new alkalinity check.","`cargo test -p tank_core` passed in full across lib and integration suites.","`cargo clippy -p tank_core -- -D warnings` passed."]}